1
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah.</b></font>

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Man, it's freezing in here.</b></font>

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:08,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, how long are they
gonna go at it today?</b></font>

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't eaten anything
since this morning.</b></font>

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm starving.</b></font>

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What should I eat
when I get home?</b></font>

7
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:25,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

8
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] No, look, I told ya,</b></font>

9
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:29,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>bigger is better.</b></font>

10
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:33,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we're gonna make it fight,
heavier is the best choice.</b></font>

11
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:36,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, then go find it
and call back later.</b></font>

12
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:38,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

13
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No guard?</b></font>

14
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did he go somewhere?</b></font>

15
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:45,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hell of a time
to take a bathroom break.</b></font>

16
00:00:45,090 --> 00:00:46,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

17
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:47,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

18
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:48,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi exhales]</b></font>

19
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:52,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, look at this!</b></font>

20
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:54,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

21
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think it eats fish sausage?</b></font>

22
00:00:55,970 --> 00:00:56,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN IN T-SHIRT] Wait a minute.</b></font>

23
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:58,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That thing was
in the tournament, wasn't it?</b></font>

24
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, here you go, little Panda...</b></font>

25
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, doofus,
pandas don't eat meat.</b></font>

26
00:01:01,310 --> 00:01:02,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They eat bamboo.</b></font>

27
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:03,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both men groan]</b></font>

28
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:06,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] Well,
this Panda eats fish sausage.</b></font>

29
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:10,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No cameras on
the emergency stairs.</b></font>

30
00:01:11,990 --> 00:01:13,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yo!</b></font>

31
00:01:14,530 --> 00:01:17,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You sure about this?
It's a risky plan.</b></font>

32
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:19,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It could cause you
trouble later on.</b></font>

33
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] It's fine, it's fine.</b></font>

34
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:25,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We just need to secure
the area by the door.</b></font>

35
00:01:35,510 --> 00:01:37,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, no, it's Kirara!</b></font>

36
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:39,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are they doing
away from Hakari?</b></font>

37
00:01:41,270 --> 00:01:42,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's Panda.</b></font>

38
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:45,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And that spiky-haired kid.</b></font>

39
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:47,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If Panda helped him
sneak in here,</b></font>

40
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:51,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that means
he's with Jujutsu High?</b></font>

41
00:01:51,530 --> 00:01:54,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which means Yu-ie is
with Jujutsu High too.</b></font>

42
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:55,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And then that means...</b></font>

43
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:59,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kin is in danger.</b></font>

44
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:01,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look, boss,
I need to tell you something.</b></font>

45
00:02:01,370 --> 00:02:04,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cell phone ringing]</b></font>

46
00:02:04,210 --> 00:02:06,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Demon Dog: Totality!</b></font>

47
00:02:06,540 --> 00:02:07,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

48
00:02:07,750 --> 00:02:09,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Panda grunts]</b></font>

49
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:11,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[roars]</b></font>

50
00:02:15,970 --> 00:02:17,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fushiguro?</b></font>

51
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:19,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

52
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:22,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
My Demon Dog was thrown back?</b></font>

53
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:25,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, judging
from what Panda said,</b></font>

54
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it couldn't get
close enough to them.</b></font>

55
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:31,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

56
00:02:31,650 --> 00:02:34,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] There, Panda
and the other two are marked.</b></font>

57
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] The monitor room!</b></font>

58
00:02:36,410 --> 00:02:39,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kirara's planning on
heading back to Hakari!</b></font>

59
00:02:39,410 --> 00:02:42,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Panda panting]</b></font>

60
00:02:42,910 --> 00:02:45,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, Kirara!
We're not your enemies.</b></font>

61
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:48,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We just want
to ask Hakari for a favor!</b></font>

62
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:51,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't believe that.
I'm disappointed in you, Panda.</b></font>

63
00:02:51,670 --> 00:02:52,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is pathetic!</b></font>

64
00:02:53,170 --> 00:02:55,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't even get close to you
while walking or running!</b></font>

65
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:57,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both panting]</b></font>

66
00:02:59,010 --> 00:03:01,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] So Kirara
can't get close to us, either?</b></font>

67
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Panda panting]</b></font>

68
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] Fushiguro?</b></font>

69
00:03:05,140 --> 00:03:06,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] It's more than just
being able to approach them.</b></font>

70
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:09,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't separate
from Demon Dog, either.</b></font>

71
00:03:09,110 --> 00:03:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What kind
of a curse technique is this?</b></font>

72
00:03:11,730 --> 00:03:12,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

73
00:03:12,990 --> 00:03:14,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Listen!
-Save it, kid!</b></font>

74
00:03:14,950 --> 00:03:17,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My passion has gone cold!</b></font>

75
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

76
00:04:51,460 --> 00:04:53,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ tense music playing]</b></font>

77
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] We're at a stalemate.</b></font>

78
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:58,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perfect.</b></font>

79
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kirara!</b></font>

80
00:05:00,090 --> 00:05:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're not currently
with Jujutsu High.</b></font>

81
00:05:02,590 --> 00:05:04,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know what Tokyo is like
right now, don't you?</b></font>

82
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:07,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm.</b></font>

83
00:05:08,430 --> 00:05:10,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] The barriers
that sprung up in each region</b></font>

84
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:11,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are related, as well.</b></font>

85
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:14,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was an unprecedented attack
of jujutsu terrorism!</b></font>

86
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:16,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We need Hakari's help.</b></font>

87
00:05:17,110 --> 00:05:19,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, you're the ones who
excluded us in the first place.</b></font>

88
00:05:19,650 --> 00:05:21,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You reap what you sow.</b></font>

89
00:05:21,660 --> 00:05:23,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] I told you,
we're not with Jujutsu High.</b></font>

90
00:05:23,910 --> 00:05:26,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What happened between you
and the higher-ups?</b></font>

91
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] They fought
with the conservatives.</b></font>

92
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course,
their idea of "conservative"</b></font>

93
00:05:30,290 --> 00:05:33,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>goes beyond just their policy
toward the regulations.</b></font>

94
00:05:33,370 --> 00:05:37,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They have set ideas of what
and what not jujutsu should be.</b></font>

95
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:39,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kugisaki's technique
is a good example.</b></font>

96
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:41,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's the kind
of classic jujutsu</b></font>

97
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:43,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the conservatives prefer.</b></font>

98
00:05:43,220 --> 00:05:45,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not stuff
like the cursed videos</b></font>

99
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:46,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that were popular a while back.</b></font>

100
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:49,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As time goes on,
even jujutsu incorporates</b></font>

101
00:05:49,180 --> 00:05:50,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>more new technologies.</b></font>

102
00:05:50,930 --> 00:05:52,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But some of those
new techniques are bound</b></font>

103
00:05:52,890 --> 00:05:54,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to make the conservatives fussy.</b></font>

104
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:58,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kin's technique is
a perfect example of that.</b></font>

105
00:05:58,610 --> 00:06:00,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why those
stupid higher-ups lost.</b></font>

106
00:06:01,570 --> 00:06:02,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here's an idea.</b></font>

107
00:06:02,740 --> 00:06:04,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why don't you have Satoru Gojo</b></font>

108
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:06,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>save your asses for you,
like always.</b></font>

109
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:09,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you have him, why do you
need us so badly, huh?</b></font>

110
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:11,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The answer is,
you're lying about needing us.</b></font>

111
00:06:11,410 --> 00:06:14,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which means you're here
for some other reason, right?</b></font>

112
00:06:16,250 --> 00:06:18,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Satoru Gojo
has been sealed away.</b></font>

113
00:06:19,170 --> 00:06:20,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the reason we lost.</b></font>

114
00:06:33,020 --> 00:06:34,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] Oh, no.</b></font>

115
00:06:34,770 --> 00:06:36,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOTH] They don't believe us!</b></font>

116
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:39,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] Well,
I can understand that.</b></font>

117
00:06:39,270 --> 00:06:42,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] But this person
is the one closest to Hakari!</b></font>

118
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:44,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Rabbit Escape!</b></font>

119
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] Bunny rabbits?</b></font>

120
00:06:47,410 --> 00:06:48,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
If we can just convince them,</b></font>

121
00:06:49,030 --> 00:06:51,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>negotiations with Hakari
will go more smoothly.</b></font>

122
00:06:54,660 --> 00:06:56,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Acrux?</b></font>

123
00:06:58,500 --> 00:06:59,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Gacrux?</b></font>

124
00:07:01,050 --> 00:07:02,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA]
That's a lot of bunnies.</b></font>

125
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's he up to?</b></font>

126
00:07:04,340 --> 00:07:06,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My technique
marks cursed energy.</b></font>

127
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:08,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So it treats sorcerers
and their shikigami</b></font>

128
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:10,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as the exact same thing.</b></font>

129
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At this rate,
the bunnies will be drawn to him</b></font>

130
00:07:12,470 --> 00:07:14,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like that doggy was,</b></font>

131
00:07:14,060 --> 00:07:16,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and he'll be crushed
under his own shikigami</b></font>

132
00:07:16,100 --> 00:07:17,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>until he suffocates.</b></font>

133
00:07:29,570 --> 00:07:30,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Panda, what happened?</b></font>

134
00:07:30,910 --> 00:07:32,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me about Rabbit Escape!</b></font>

135
00:07:32,490 --> 00:07:34,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They were almost
as cute as I am!</b></font>

136
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:35,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't mean how they looked!</b></font>

137
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:38,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What were they able
to approach and not approach?</b></font>

138
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:41,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh. They were able to
get up to that second floor</b></font>

139
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:42,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with no problem!</b></font>

140
00:07:42,550 --> 00:07:45,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But they couldn't get
near Kirara or the door!</b></font>

141
00:07:45,550 --> 00:07:47,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Panda, do you have
anything written on your body?</b></font>

142
00:07:48,010 --> 00:07:49,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A star and a name somewhere?</b></font>

143
00:07:50,930 --> 00:07:54,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps] Oh! I-M-A-I?</b></font>

144
00:07:54,810 --> 00:07:56,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] I should have one too.</b></font>

145
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:59,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[PANDA] Imai? It says "Imai!"
-There.</b></font>

146
00:07:59,150 --> 00:08:00,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
Just like on the rabbits.</b></font>

147
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's probably on Totality, too.</b></font>

148
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know anything
about their technique.</b></font>

149
00:08:06,570 --> 00:08:07,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait a minute.</b></font>

150
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:09,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've got it!</b></font>

151
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This technique is
based on a constellation!</b></font>

152
00:08:12,620 --> 00:08:14,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA]
Anyone looking at the sky</b></font>

153
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:15,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>could figure that part out.</b></font>

154
00:08:15,330 --> 00:08:17,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
And the constellation is...</b></font>

155
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Southern Cross.</b></font>

156
00:08:29,130 --> 00:08:30,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shit!</b></font>

157
00:08:30,470 --> 00:08:32,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We both let it
show on our faces.</b></font>

158
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:35,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He gave me a look like,
"Seriously?"</b></font>

159
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:37,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He just guessed my technique
was based on the Southern Cross,</b></font>

160
00:08:38,020 --> 00:08:39,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but he wasn't sure about it.</b></font>

161
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:42,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I gave him
that same stupid look.</b></font>

162
00:08:42,190 --> 00:08:43,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I confirmed it for him.</b></font>

163
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:47,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If he figures out any more
of my technique,</b></font>

164
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he'll be able
to enter the monitor room.</b></font>

165
00:08:49,570 --> 00:08:51,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to stop him here.</b></font>

166
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:53,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
Back in a stalemate again?</b></font>

167
00:08:56,290 --> 00:08:58,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But was it really
the Southern Cross?</b></font>

168
00:08:59,540 --> 00:09:01,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tsumiki taught me that.</b></font>

169
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:03,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't really know
about the other ones.</b></font>

170
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:06,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But isn't the Southern Cross
a four-star constellation?</b></font>

171
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:08,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] Fushiguro?</b></font>

172
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:11,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Looks like I can
still get close to Panda.</b></font>

173
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:13,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Panda,
do you happen to know</b></font>

174
00:09:14,010 --> 00:09:16,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if the Southern Cross
has four stars in it?</b></font>

175
00:09:16,310 --> 00:09:18,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, well, I mean, it's a cross.</b></font>

176
00:09:19,270 --> 00:09:21,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So there has to be
at least four.</b></font>

177
00:09:26,020 --> 00:09:28,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kirara's technique
must apply one of the stars</b></font>

178
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the Southern Cross
to each of us.</b></font>

179
00:09:30,860 --> 00:09:32,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I thought it might
use that to force us</b></font>

180
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:34,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to maintain a certain distance.</b></font>

181
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:36,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But Kirara can
approach the door,</b></font>

182
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:38,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and you and I can
approach each other.</b></font>

183
00:09:39,500 --> 00:09:41,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] So maybe
Kirara and the door stars</b></font>

184
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:42,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are repelling ours,</b></font>

185
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:45,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like opposite magnets
push each other away?</b></font>

186
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:47,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, that doesn't sound right.</b></font>

187
00:09:47,210 --> 00:09:49,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If that were true,
Kirara would just flee</b></font>

188
00:09:49,130 --> 00:09:50,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>into the monitor room.</b></font>

189
00:09:50,130 --> 00:09:51,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] You're right.</b></font>

190
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:54,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And if they hugged the inside
of the door, we'd be stuck.</b></font>

191
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:57,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, wait a minute.
What about this?</b></font>

192
00:09:58,180 --> 00:10:00,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Star A is able
to approach Star B,</b></font>

193
00:10:00,730 --> 00:10:02,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but B can't approach A.</b></font>

194
00:10:02,850 --> 00:10:06,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Each star has only one other
star they're compatible with.</b></font>

195
00:10:06,230 --> 00:10:09,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And they cannot approach
any other star but that one,</b></font>

196
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like in rock-paper-scissors.</b></font>

197
00:10:11,650 --> 00:10:13,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you and I can
approach each other.</b></font>

198
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:16,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We have no problem
moving toward one another.</b></font>

199
00:10:16,950 --> 00:10:18,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So that's a no?</b></font>

200
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:22,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Maybe it's
more like a stamp rally.</b></font>

201
00:10:22,830 --> 00:10:24,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where you have to
follow a set route</b></font>

202
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:26,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and approach each one in order.</b></font>

203
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:29,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And things with the same star
get drawn together.</b></font>

204
00:10:30,210 --> 00:10:31,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's interesting.</b></font>

205
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But what if
the sorcerer isn't counted</b></font>

206
00:10:33,170 --> 00:10:35,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as one of the stars
in the constellation?</b></font>

207
00:10:35,340 --> 00:10:36,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That can't be the case.</b></font>

208
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because they were forced
to stay away from Demon Dog.</b></font>

209
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:41,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just look at Kirara.</b></font>

210
00:10:41,930 --> 00:10:44,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're obviously on high alert
about our next move.</b></font>

211
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:46,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because they're afraid
that while they're not looking,</b></font>

212
00:10:46,610 --> 00:10:47,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we manage to get what we need</b></font>

213
00:10:47,810 --> 00:10:49,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in order to enter
that monitor room.</b></font>

214
00:10:50,150 --> 00:10:52,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So forget four stars,
there's at least five or more.</b></font>

215
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:54,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right.</b></font>

216
00:10:54,150 --> 00:10:56,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If my stamp rally theory
is correct,</b></font>

217
00:10:56,530 --> 00:10:57,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then with only four stars,</b></font>

218
00:10:58,030 --> 00:11:00,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we should be able
to approach Kirara freely.</b></font>

219
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:02,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But we can't.</b></font>

220
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So there has to be a fifth star.</b></font>

221
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And that's the star
we have to pass through</b></font>

222
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:07,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to reach Kirara and that door.</b></font>

223
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:10,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What if there are
six or seven stars?</b></font>

224
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:11,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, well, I'm really hoping</b></font>

225
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:13,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that's not what
we're up against.</b></font>

226
00:11:13,470 --> 00:11:15,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's confusing enough
with five stars.</b></font>

227
00:11:16,130 --> 00:11:18,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] If they figured it out,</b></font>

228
00:11:18,050 --> 00:11:20,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then I have to attack!</b></font>

229
00:11:21,350 --> 00:11:23,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[car alarm wailing]</b></font>

230
00:11:26,890 --> 00:11:28,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[groans]
-[MEGUMI] Panda!</b></font>

231
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] I'm okay.
Don't worry about me.</b></font>

232
00:11:33,780 --> 00:11:35,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just go!</b></font>

233
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:36,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And find that star!</b></font>

234
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans, grunts]</b></font>

235
00:11:40,870 --> 00:11:42,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, don’t go
throwing cars right now!</b></font>

236
00:11:42,990 --> 00:11:44,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Panda grunts]</b></font>

237
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

238
00:11:47,620 --> 00:11:50,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] The same Imai star
on you is on that car!</b></font>

239
00:11:50,340 --> 00:11:52,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you throw it,
it'll just come back.</b></font>

240
00:11:52,050 --> 00:11:54,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or pull you toward it
like Demon Dog did to me!</b></font>

241
00:11:55,470 --> 00:11:56,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They probably
have to touch the target</b></font>

242
00:11:57,010 --> 00:11:58,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to plant a star on them.</b></font>

243
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, that can't be right!</b></font>

244
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:02,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kirara hasn't touched me
or Rabbit Escape!</b></font>

245
00:12:02,930 --> 00:12:04,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They only touched Demon Dog.</b></font>

246
00:12:04,850 --> 00:12:07,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Meaning,
Kirara isn't tagging objects.</b></font>

247
00:12:07,810 --> 00:12:09,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're tagging cursed energy!</b></font>

248
00:12:09,690 --> 00:12:11,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In order to tag doors and cars,</b></font>

249
00:12:11,650 --> 00:12:13,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they might need someone
to imbue cursed energy</b></font>

250
00:12:13,860 --> 00:12:15,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>into them ahead of time.</b></font>

251
00:12:19,410 --> 00:12:20,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I knew it!</b></font>

252
00:12:21,950 --> 00:12:24,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The car has residual cursed
energy from someone else!</b></font>

253
00:12:25,370 --> 00:12:27,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If the technique
doesn't cover a wide range,</b></font>

254
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:30,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then traces
of the other star should be!</b></font>

255
00:12:30,170 --> 00:12:32,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Panda exclaiming]</b></font>

256
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:34,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

257
00:12:35,550 --> 00:12:36,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

258
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:43,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] There! The fifth star!</b></font>

259
00:12:44,890 --> 00:12:46,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't see any more
residual cursed energy</b></font>

260
00:12:46,890 --> 00:12:48,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from anyone other than us.</b></font>

261
00:12:48,730 --> 00:12:51,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kirara's already marked
their own cursed energy,</b></font>

262
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:53,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so they can't use it
to mark objects</b></font>

263
00:12:53,110 --> 00:12:55,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with the same Acrux star
that they labeled me with.</b></font>

264
00:12:56,070 --> 00:12:57,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Meaning, they can't
launch things at me</b></font>

265
00:12:57,740 --> 00:12:59,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like they did with that car.</b></font>

266
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:04,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once I touch that,
I can approach Kirara!</b></font>

267
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:08,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Fushiguro's
hypothesis was correct.</b></font>

268
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kirara's cursed technique,
Love Rendezvous,</b></font>

269
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:13,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>assigns one of five stars</b></font>

270
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:15,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the cursed energy
of their targets,</b></font>

271
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:17,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>using the Southern Cross
as a base.</b></font>

272
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:20,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For one star
to approach another,</b></font>

273
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:23,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it must follow
a predetermined order.</b></font>

274
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:26,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Things marked with the same star
are attracted to each other.</b></font>

275
00:13:28,930 --> 00:13:30,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Very impressive.</b></font>

276
00:13:30,390 --> 00:13:33,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe you actually
figured out my technique.</b></font>

277
00:13:33,900 --> 00:13:35,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Panda! Here, catch 'em!</b></font>

278
00:13:35,190 --> 00:13:37,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm... [grunts]</b></font>

279
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:42,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

280
00:13:47,950 --> 00:13:49,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

281
00:13:49,410 --> 00:13:51,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]
That order was nearest</b></font>

282
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:53,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the farthest star.</b></font>

283
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:55,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Constellations may look flat,</b></font>

284
00:13:55,340 --> 00:13:57,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but they do,
of course, have depth,</b></font>

285
00:13:57,590 --> 00:14:00,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And each star has
a different distance from Earth.</b></font>

286
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're so smart,
I bet you thought</b></font>

287
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:05,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's no way I could throw
objects at you any longer.</b></font>

288
00:14:05,930 --> 00:14:07,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I can just
lift the Ginan star,</b></font>

289
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:09,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>placed on my own cursed energy,</b></font>

290
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:11,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and mark things
with the same Acrux star</b></font>

291
00:14:11,770 --> 00:14:13,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that I put on you!</b></font>

292
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:21,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps] What?</b></font>

293
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How?</b></font>

294
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:25,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where did it come from?</b></font>

295
00:14:26,780 --> 00:14:27,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The boy,</b></font>

296
00:14:27,990 --> 00:14:30,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he never dismissed
his doggy shikigami.</b></font>

297
00:14:30,540 --> 00:14:32,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did he figure out which
of the same tagged objects</b></font>

298
00:14:32,790 --> 00:14:34,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would be drawn to the other?</b></font>

299
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:37,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then he put a wall between
himself and the shikigami</b></font>

300
00:14:37,420 --> 00:14:40,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so the shikigami would be
drawn into the wall.</b></font>

301
00:14:40,250 --> 00:14:41,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then he unleashed the doggy</b></font>

302
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:43,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when I was in a line
between them.</b></font>

303
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:47,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Love Rendezvous, cancel.</b></font>

304
00:14:49,970 --> 00:14:51,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

305
00:14:54,810 --> 00:14:56,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kirara yelps]</b></font>

306
00:15:06,110 --> 00:15:07,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please, Kirara.</b></font>

307
00:15:07,570 --> 00:15:08,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just hear us out.</b></font>

308
00:15:22,210 --> 00:15:23,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA]
Did you really do that?</b></font>

309
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:25,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Set me up with my own technique?</b></font>

310
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:27,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no way
you could have known</b></font>

311
00:15:27,430 --> 00:15:29,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you or the doggy would get
pulled toward the other.</b></font>

312
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:32,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I took a gamble,
but now I know for certain.</b></font>

313
00:15:32,810 --> 00:15:34,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The one
with the greater cursed energy</b></font>

314
00:15:34,350 --> 00:15:35,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>pulls the other towards it.</b></font>

315
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:39,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The first time I was
pulled into Demon Dog.</b></font>

316
00:15:39,230 --> 00:15:40,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But when I strengthened
my cursed energy</b></font>

317
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:43,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to guard against
your incoming attack,</b></font>

318
00:15:43,190 --> 00:15:44,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the opposite happened.</b></font>

319
00:15:45,780 --> 00:15:47,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're really just a first-year?</b></font>

320
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:49,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You aren't cute at all,
you know.</b></font>

321
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:55,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Please.</b></font>

322
00:15:55,580 --> 00:15:56,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We don't have time.</b></font>

323
00:15:57,210 --> 00:15:58,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please hear us out.</b></font>

324
00:16:00,540 --> 00:16:02,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kirara sighs] All right, fine.</b></font>

325
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:04,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Yuji groans]
-[crashing]</b></font>

326
00:16:05,630 --> 00:16:06,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

327
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scraping]</b></font>

328
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:09,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOTH] Hm?</b></font>

329
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:12,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Itadori?</b></font>

330
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:13,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Fushiguro.</b></font>

331
00:16:13,350 --> 00:16:15,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans] Panda.</b></font>

332
00:16:15,270 --> 00:16:16,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stay out of this.</b></font>

333
00:16:23,270 --> 00:16:24,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

334
00:16:24,820 --> 00:16:25,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growls]</b></font>

335
00:16:28,910 --> 00:16:30,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] Underestimating me, huh?</b></font>

336
00:16:33,330 --> 00:16:34,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

337
00:16:35,870 --> 00:16:37,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI]
What is it with this kid?</b></font>

338
00:16:37,870 --> 00:16:40,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's not even trying
to dodge my punches.</b></font>

339
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You crazy or what?</b></font>

340
00:16:43,420 --> 00:16:45,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] This isn't like
the fight in Shibuya.</b></font>

341
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:49,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is me
looking Hakari in the eyes</b></font>

342
00:16:49,630 --> 00:16:51,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>until he accepts me.</b></font>

343
00:16:52,470 --> 00:16:54,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't dodge anymore.</b></font>

344
00:16:54,350 --> 00:16:56,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't fight back.</b></font>

345
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:59,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not until he caves.</b></font>

346
00:16:59,390 --> 00:17:00,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How's this?</b></font>

347
00:17:00,810 --> 00:17:02,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll listen
to what you have to say.</b></font>

348
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:05,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For as long as
you remain standing!</b></font>

349
00:17:05,110 --> 00:17:06,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] Kin, baby, stop!</b></font>

350
00:17:06,860 --> 00:17:08,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>These kids just want your help.</b></font>

351
00:17:08,740 --> 00:17:10,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just hear them out, okay?</b></font>

352
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:13,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just said I would, didn't I?</b></font>

353
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:20,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, Itadori.</b></font>

354
00:17:20,710 --> 00:17:21,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why me?</b></font>

355
00:17:22,630 --> 00:17:25,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the first time
we've met, right?</b></font>

356
00:17:25,630 --> 00:17:28,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So why did you come to me?</b></font>

357
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's because of your strength.</b></font>

358
00:17:30,630 --> 00:17:32,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All of my friends
told me you were strong.</b></font>

359
00:17:34,300 --> 00:17:36,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course. Figures.</b></font>

360
00:17:36,810 --> 00:17:39,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When one sorcerer
asks another for help,</b></font>

361
00:17:39,430 --> 00:17:40,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's an understood agreement</b></font>

362
00:17:40,690 --> 00:17:43,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that they're asking him
to risk his life.</b></font>

363
00:17:43,940 --> 00:17:46,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So if I'm gonna
throw my chips in with you,</b></font>

364
00:17:46,610 --> 00:17:48,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you better show me
that you have a passion</b></font>

365
00:17:48,940 --> 00:17:50,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>worth risking my life for!</b></font>

366
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:52,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right here and now.</b></font>

367
00:17:52,570 --> 00:17:54,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet you offer me nothing,</b></font>

368
00:17:54,490 --> 00:17:56,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>saying you're just here
following orders.</b></font>

369
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:58,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What the hell, old man Yaga</b></font>

370
00:17:58,700 --> 00:18:01,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>should be weeding out
losers like you!</b></font>

371
00:18:04,790 --> 00:18:06,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't have any passion.</b></font>

372
00:18:07,050 --> 00:18:08,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

373
00:18:08,050 --> 00:18:09,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm nothing but a cog.</b></font>

374
00:18:10,340 --> 00:18:12,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A cog in a sorcerer's machine.</b></font>

375
00:18:12,630 --> 00:18:14,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That keeps exorcising curses.</b></font>

376
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A cog.</b></font>

377
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:20,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, wait, wait.
Are you for real?</b></font>

378
00:18:21,180 --> 00:18:23,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Cause that's damn boring.</b></font>

379
00:18:23,390 --> 00:18:25,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stop it! Enough, Itadori!</b></font>

380
00:18:30,030 --> 00:18:31,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kinji grunts]</b></font>

381
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:42,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] Hurts, doesn't it?</b></font>

382
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:45,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know what Gojo once told me?</b></font>

383
00:18:45,710 --> 00:18:48,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That my cursed energy
was coarser and grittier</b></font>

384
00:18:48,540 --> 00:18:50,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than anyone else
he's ever known.</b></font>

385
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you dead yet?</b></font>

386
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:56,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Panda!</b></font>

387
00:18:56,970 --> 00:18:58,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Who?
-You and Sea Urchin Head!</b></font>

388
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take Itadori's body
and get lost!</b></font>

389
00:19:00,970 --> 00:19:02,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And don't ever come back!</b></font>

390
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:05,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

391
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:09,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] He took
three unguarded blows.</b></font>

392
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:12,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus I hit him with a whole lot
of punches before, too.</b></font>

393
00:19:12,070 --> 00:19:14,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What the hell
are you made of, kid?</b></font>

394
00:19:14,530 --> 00:19:16,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm nothing but a cog.</b></font>

395
00:19:16,570 --> 00:19:18,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But cogs have a function,
you know.</b></font>

396
00:19:19,620 --> 00:19:22,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My function is
to keep exorcising curses.</b></font>

397
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:25,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I need you
to achieve that,</b></font>

398
00:19:26,210 --> 00:19:28,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then I'll play along
until you agree to it.</b></font>

399
00:19:42,930 --> 00:19:44,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kinji Hakari.</b></font>

400
00:19:45,270 --> 00:19:46,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's your function?</b></font>

401
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:49,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] This kid.</b></font>

402
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:53,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So this is what
a cog's passion looks like.</b></font>

403
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:58,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine. I'll keep punching.</b></font>

404
00:19:58,700 --> 00:20:00,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] Kin, baby.</b></font>

405
00:20:00,530 --> 00:20:02,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can tell you're all heated up.</b></font>

406
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:04,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

407
00:20:06,660 --> 00:20:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KINJI] It's true.
The fever never lies.</b></font>

408
00:20:13,130 --> 00:20:14,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Get down here, you three.</b></font>

409
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:15,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Panda whimpers]</b></font>

410
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:18,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's cut a deal.</b></font>

411
00:20:20,140 --> 00:20:22,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Uh,
you mean it's resolved?</b></font>

412
00:20:22,890 --> 00:20:25,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you just convince him
to do that?</b></font>

413
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:27,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Mm-hm.
-Thank you for saving his life.</b></font>

414
00:20:27,690 --> 00:20:28,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All good.</b></font>

415
00:20:29,230 --> 00:20:31,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We may hate the upper brass
at Jujutsu High,</b></font>

416
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:32,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it's undeniable,</b></font>

417
00:20:33,020 --> 00:20:35,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kin's fever burns hottest
when he's helping others.</b></font>

418
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:40,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUJI] Ow!
-[PANDA] Hmm?</b></font>

419
00:20:41,570 --> 00:20:45,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ding-dong! Ding-dong, ding-dong,
ding-dong, ding-dong, ding-dong!</b></font>

420
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:46,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

421
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:47,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] Please be advised.</b></font>

422
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:49,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Effective immediately,</b></font>

423
00:20:49,330 --> 00:20:51,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a player has added a new rule
to the Culling Game.</b></font>

424
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Rule number nine!</b></font>

425
00:20:53,340 --> 00:20:55,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Players will know
each other's information,</b></font>

426
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:57,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>first names, last names,</b></font>

427
00:20:57,550 --> 00:20:59,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>number of points accumulated,</b></font>

428
00:20:59,130 --> 00:21:00,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>current colony,
and number of rules</b></font>

429
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>added to the game by you.</b></font>

430
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:10,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have gained five points
for a kill.</b></font>

431
00:21:10,730 --> 00:21:12,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HAJIME]
You're damn right, I killed him.</b></font>

432
00:21:17,030 --> 00:21:20,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not a single one of these guys
was strong enough.</b></font>

433
00:21:20,280 --> 00:21:23,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It really was so much better
400 years ago.</b></font>

434
00:21:23,950 --> 00:21:25,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growls]</b></font>

435
00:21:25,790 --> 00:21:28,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where are you, Sukuna?</b></font>

436
00:21:32,670 --> 00:21:35,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] You have
exceeded 200 points.</b></font>

437
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:38,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would you like
to consume 100 points</b></font>

438
00:21:38,130 --> 00:21:40,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by adding a rule
to the Culling Game?</b></font>

439
00:21:40,630 --> 00:21:42,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HAJIME] Oh, right.</b></font>

440
00:21:42,140 --> 00:21:43,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The rules.</b></font>

441
00:21:44,260 --> 00:21:45,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I knew their names</b></font>

442
00:21:46,060 --> 00:21:48,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and their points,
telling me their strength.</b></font>

443
00:21:49,350 --> 00:21:51,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, but points go down
when adding a rule.</b></font>

444
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:55,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I'd need the number
of rules they added, too.</b></font>

445
00:21:55,820 --> 00:21:58,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And knowing which colony
they're in would be valuable.</b></font>

446
00:21:59,030 --> 00:22:00,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kogane.</b></font>

447
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:01,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Add a rule.</b></font>

448
00:22:01,700 --> 00:22:05,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reveal that information
for every player.</b></font>

449
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:12,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

450
00:23:41,550 --> 00:23:44,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KENJAKU] You're in the space
between dreams and reality.</b></font>

451
00:23:44,090 --> 00:23:45,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a curse.</b></font>

452
00:23:45,090 --> 00:23:46,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]
How do you know my name?</b></font>

453
00:23:46,180 --> 00:23:47,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] I'm not like Itadori.</b></font>

454
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:50,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] Once you step inside,
you, too, become a player.</b></font>

455
00:23:50,430 --> 00:23:52,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] And make them
add a rule to let Tsumiki</b></font>

456
00:23:52,470 --> 00:23:53,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>escape the Culling Game!</b></font>

